WearMouse
https://github.com/ginkage/wearmouse
Copyright 2018 Google LLC
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

WristCursor is derived from WearMouse. The following are taken from that project,
in modified form:

  * The Bluetooth HID device implementation - the composite SDP report descriptor
    (mouse, keyboard and battery collections), HidDeviceApp, HidDeviceProfile and
    the report encoders in com.wristcursor.app.bluetooth.
  * The native sensor-fusion orientation tracker under app/src/main/cpp, and the
    Java layer that drives it in com.wristcursor.app.sensors.
  * The input controllers and gesture detectors in com.wristcursor.app.input,
    including the quaternion-to-yaw/pitch pointer transfer function and the
    stabilisation filter.
  * The device pairing, mode selection and settings UI structure in
    com.wristcursor.app.ui.

Original authors and contributors to WearMouse include Ivan Podogov (ginkage)
and Fabian Henneke (FabianHenneke).

